1
00:00:00,133 --> 00:00:02,933
flowmaid renders Mermaid diagrams in pure Rust.

2
00:00:03,333 --> 00:00:07,467
Text in, clean SVG out.

3
00:00:07,933 --> 00:00:11,233
Over a hundred times faster than mermaid.js.

4
00:00:11,767 --> 00:00:14,900
Twelve diagram types, from flowcharts to sankey.

5
00:00:15,433 --> 00:00:19,833
In the browser, drag a node, and its edges follow.

6
00:00:20,767 --> 00:00:25,100
flowcli draws them in your terminal, and redraws when you save.

7
00:00:25,633 --> 00:00:29,967
In dbx, flowmaid lays out your database schema as an ERD.

8
00:00:30,967 --> 00:00:32,833
flowmaid is open source.

9
00:00:32,833 --> 00:00:35,933
Try it in your browser, or cargo add flowmaid.
